cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "The Polymathic Universe: The Parallel Straits"
message: "If you refer to this world or any volume within it, please cite it as below."
type: software
abstract: >-
  A worldbuilding atlas kept as self-contained HTML volumes: a parallel equatorial
  port and its seven great schools, with their designs, histories, magic system and
  the real-world research beneath them. Made toward fiction still to be written, and
  numbered in the order the work was done.
